The exact v1.3 Target A is:

> **Two-well configuration-transfer / inner-band Hall-rigidity theorem.**
>
> In a super-boundary survivor \(\rho/D\to\infty\), combine
>
> 1. the original saturated minimizer's
>    \(\rho/24-o(\rho)\) disjoint matched two-well Gabriel neighborhoods; and
> 2. the independently constructed scaffold's inner-band conflict graph with deficiency
